letitedit: subtitle_feed gives every cue that overlaps the producer's in..out range, clipped to it, so a caption that
runs to the video's last frame or past it (or began before an exported range's in point) is drawn. From
engine-patches/mlt-subtitle-feed-range; applies on MLT 63218a28d21f1e64b5b9e6671b4ff9146023282c (module plus).

